{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-112957-r4620602","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Crock Pot Potato Soup","sourcePageId":112957,"sourceRevision":"4620602","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-02-25T21:48:37Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Schmudde","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Crock%20Pot%20Potato%20Soup&oldid=4620602","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:30.966Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Gluten-free recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for soup","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using celery","Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock","Category:Recipes using evaporated milk","Category:Recipes using onion","Category:Recipes using potato","Category:Slow cooker recipes","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"342f24c3500d4677c4ffa6a4cd0cec34c3d2afcf7eea9b4cd93dbe4b54c2bbcc","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Soup recipes|servings=8|time=12 hours|difficulty=1}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American cuisine]] \n| [[Cookbook:Soups|Soups]]\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n* 5 large [[Cookbook:Potato|potatoes]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 3 medium [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]], diced\n* 5 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n* 1 stalk [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]], diced\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Black pepper]], to taste\n* 4 cups [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]] [[Cookbook:Broth|broth]]\n* 4 to 5 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* 1 (13-ounce) can [[Cookbook:Condensed milk|evaporated milk]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# In a slow cooker, combine potatoes, onions, water, parsley, celery, salt, pepper, chicken broth and butter.\n# Cook until done -- on low heat, 9 to 11 hours, or on high heat, 3 to 4 hours.\n# When done, add milk and reheat.\n# Serve plain or use an immersion blender/put mixture in [[Cookbook:Blender|blender]] for a smoother soup.\n# Reheat if necessary.\n\n==Tips, Notes, and Variations==\n\n* [[Cookbook:Garnish|Garnish]] each serving with a dollop of [[Cookbook:Sour Cream|sour cream]] and [[Cookbook:Chive|chives]], if desired.\n* If you don't have evaporated milk on hand, it's possible to mix 1.5 cups of cold milk with flour to form a thick slurry to mix it in with good results.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Slow cooker recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[category:Gluten-free recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using evaporated milk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken broth and stock]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Crock Pot Potato Soup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"5 large potatoes, diced","sourceText":"5 large potatoes, diced","amountText":"5 large potatoes, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 medium onions, diced","sourceText":"3 medium onions, diced","amountText":"3 medium